
Airport
  returns the airport name
  returns own capacity
  starts with zero routes
  increments route count with add_route
  print_tree includes the name
  print_tree includes the capacity

RegionalNetwork
  returns the region name
  get_capacity sums its airports
  get_route_count sums routes across airports
  remove reduces get_capacity
  empty region has capacity 0 and route count 0
  print_tree includes name and airports

AirportNetwork
  get_capacity recurses through regions
  get_route_count recurses through all levels
  remove region updates totals

Uniformity (core pattern guarantee)
  same call on leaf and composite
  three-level tree resolves from root with one call

